nue to work on subsequent (later) driver releases. In addition, CUDA minor version compatibility allows applications to run on a driver older than the corresponding driver branch, within the ranges shown below. The installed driver must meet or exceed the minimum required version for the CUDA Toolkit. For details, see the 【9†CUDA Compatibility Guide】 and 【10†CUDA Compatibility and Upgrades】.\nL88: Table 3 CUDA Toolkit and Minimum Required Driver Version for CUDA Minor Version Compatibility【11†】\nL89: CTK Version  | Driver Range for Minor Version Compatibility\nL90: --- | ---\nL91:  | Min  | Max\nL92: --- | --- | ---\nL93: 13.x  | >= 580  | N/A\nL94: 12.x  | >= 525  | < 580\nL95: 11.x  | >= 450  | < 525\nL96: \nL97: CUDA 11.0 shipped with earlier driver versions. Minor-version compatibility across the CUDA 11.x family requires driver version 450.80.02 or later on Linux, or 452.39 or later on Windows.\nL98: \nL99: Older CUDA versions (12.9 and earlier)\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\ncuda-graph-with-dynamic-parameters/gpu_graph.cpp at release · hummingtree/cuda-graph-with-dynamic-parameters · GitHub (https://github.com/hummingtree/cuda-graph-with-dynamic-parameters/blob/release/gpu_graph.cpp)\nciteturn10view3 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last month; Content type: text/html; Source: find({\"ref_id\":\"turn8view3\",\"pattern\":\"cudaGraphExecKernelNodeSetParams\"}); Total lines: 552\nL473: if (_graph_exec != nullptr) { cudaErrCheck(cudaGraphExecDestroy(_graph_exec)); }\nL474: \nL475: need_instantiation = true;\nL476: \nL477: } else {\nL478: \nL479: // The update is successful, no need to re-instantiate\nL480: \nL481: need_instantiation = false;\nL482: \nL483: }\nL484: \nL485: } else {\nL486: \nL487: need_instantiation = true;\nL488: \nL489: }\nL490: \nL491: if (need_instantiation) {\nL492: \nL493: cudaErrCheck(cudaGraphInstantiate(&_graph_exec, _graph, nullptr, nullptr, 0));\nL494: \nL495: }\nL496: \nL497: _instantiated = true;\nL498: \nL499: }\nL500: \nL501: void gpu_graph_t::launch_graph(cudaStream_t s) {\nL502: \nL503: if (_instantiated) {\nL504: \nL505: cudaErrCheck(cudaGraphLaunch(_graph_exec, s));\nL506: } else {\nL507: \nL508: fprintf(stderr, \"Launching an invalid or uninstantiated graph\\n\");\nL509: \nL510: }\nL511: \nL512: }\nL513: \nL514: void gpu_graph_t::add_kernel_node(size_t key, cudaKernelNodeParams params, cudaStream_t stream)\nL515: \nL516: {\nL517: \nL518: // Get the currently capturing graph\nL519: \nL520: cudaStreamCaptureStatus capture_status;\nL521: \nL522: cudaGraph_t graph;\nL523: \nL524: const cudaGraphNode_t *deps;\nL525: \nL526: size_t dep_count;\nL527: \nL528: cudaErrCheck(cudaStreamGetCaptureInfo_v2(stream, &capture_status, nullptr, &graph, &deps, &dep_count));\nL529: \nL530: // Now add a new node\nL531: \nL532: cudaGraphNode_t new_node;\nL533: cudaErrCheck(cudaGraphAddKernelNode(&new_node, graph, deps, dep_count, &params));\nL534: \nL535: _node_map[key] = new_node;\nL536: \nL537: // Update the stream dependency\nL538: \nL539: cudaErrCheck(cudaStreamUpdateCaptureDependencies(stream, &new_node, 1, 1));\nL540: \nL541: }\nL542: \nL543: void gpu_graph_t::update_kernel_node(size_t key, cudaKernelNodeParams params)\nL544: \nL545: {\nL546: \nL547: cudaErrCheck(cudaGraphExecKernelNodeSetParams(_graph_exec, _node_map[key], &params));\nL548: \nL549: }\nL550: \nL551: You can’t perform that action at this time.\n"
